counters, very lightweight

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:18.240
from -- you can use your release
view to actually run that

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:21.600
and use the hardware counters
to collect the profile,

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:24.300
so that you can enjoy the
same performance benefit,

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:27.420
but without all those friction
that we just talked about then.

