orange coffee maker.

00:39:05.490 --> 00:39:10.050
And so, that was all done
exactly as a Windows CLI.

00:39:10.050 --> 00:39:11.970
Right? It's .exe.

00:39:11.970 --> 00:39:13.680
It was all Windows
inputs and outputs.

00:39:13.680 --> 00:39:15.060
I opened a Windows file.

00:39:15.060 --> 00:39:17.310
But everything, all of
